[[:db/add "a5e7218d-a99d-5fe8-9e78-d80c8d7e047c" :answer/id #uuid "a5e7218d-a99d-5fe8-9e78-d80c8d7e047c"] [:db/add "a5e7218d-a99d-5fe8-9e78-d80c8d7e047c" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "a5e7218d-a99d-5fe8-9e78-d80c8d7e047c" :answer/value "-2"] [:db/ensure "a5e7218d-a99d-5fe8-9e78-d80c8d7e047c" :answer/validate] [:db/add "ae3042e4-abbe-5130-aa21-f26f8c8b01c8" :answer-field/id #uuid "ae3042e4-abbe-5130-aa21-f26f8c8b01c8"] [:db/add "ae3042e4-abbe-5130-aa21-f26f8c8b01c8" :answer-field/key "field-1"] [:db/add "ae3042e4-abbe-5130-aa21-f26f8c8b01c8" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "ae3042e4-abbe-5130-aa21-f26f8c8b01c8" :answer-field/choices "a5e7218d-a99d-5fe8-9e78-d80c8d7e047c"] [:db/add "ae3042e4-abbe-5130-aa21-f26f8c8b01c8" :answer-field/correct "a5e7218d-a99d-5fe8-9e78-d80c8d7e047c"] [:db/ensure "ae3042e4-abbe-5130-aa21-f26f8c8b01c8" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "0a619b4d-61fa-561f-8fa2-fa7e88541f6b" :answer/id #uuid "0a619b4d-61fa-561f-8fa2-fa7e88541f6b"] [:db/add "0a619b4d-61fa-561f-8fa2-fa7e88541f6b" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "0a619b4d-61fa-561f-8fa2-fa7e88541f6b" :answer/value "3"] [:db/ensure "0a619b4d-61fa-561f-8fa2-fa7e88541f6b" :answer/validate] [:db/add "50b7d522-b38d-5763-91fe-154a18de07ee" :answer-field/id #uuid "50b7d522-b38d-5763-91fe-154a18de07ee"] [:db/add "50b7d522-b38d-5763-91fe-154a18de07ee" :answer-field/key "field-2"] [:db/add "50b7d522-b38d-5763-91fe-154a18de07ee" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "50b7d522-b38d-5763-91fe-154a18de07ee" :answer-field/choices "0a619b4d-61fa-561f-8fa2-fa7e88541f6b"] [:db/add "50b7d522-b38d-5763-91fe-154a18de07ee" :answer-field/correct "0a619b4d-61fa-561f-8fa2-fa7e88541f6b"] [:db/ensure "50b7d522-b38d-5763-91fe-154a18de07ee" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "dd30c11b-b5c7-5075-8cd9-10d8eaf23ea0" :question/id #uuid "dd30c11b-b5c7-5075-8cd9-10d8eaf23ea0"] [:db/add "dd30c11b-b5c7-5075-8cd9-10d8eaf23ea0" :question/problem "The vectors are drawn on a square grid: $\\overrightarrow{OA}=\\mathbf{a}$, $\\overrightarrow{OB}=\\mathbf{b}$, and $\\overrightarrow{OC}=\\mathbf{c}$.\n\n![Vector diagram](images/a4/a4e7fa23be759035d5765a80ed9d78b7fb7be560ec38fd24aedc172abd2b0b99.png)\n\nGiven that $\\mathbf{c}=\\lambda\\mathbf{a}+\\mu\\mathbf{b}$, find $\\lambda$ and $\\mu$.\n\n$\\lambda=$ {{field-1}}\n\n$\\mu=$ {{field-2}}"] [:db/add "dd30c11b-b5c7-5075-8cd9-10d8eaf23ea0" :question/worked-solution "![Completed vector route](images/9b/9b7f2c9f69c8d8661ec513da0e8a3d0a8a7eb31d2826162aab0a2267ff659425.png)\n\nConstruct the route $O\\to X\\to C$, first parallel to $\\mathbf{a}$ and then parallel to $\\mathbf{b}$.\n\nAlong $OX$, move $2$ squares left and $2$ squares down. A copy of $\\mathbf{a}$ moves $1$ square right and $1$ square up. Thus $OX=2|\\mathbf{a}|$ and the segment points in the opposite direction to $\\mathbf{a}$. Hence $\\overrightarrow{OX}=-2\\mathbf{a}$.\n\nAlong $XC$, move $9$ squares right and $6$ squares up. A copy of $\\mathbf{b}$ moves $3$ squares right and $2$ squares up. Thus $XC=3|\\mathbf{b}|$ and the segment points in the same direction to $\\mathbf{b}$. Hence $\\overrightarrow{XC}=3\\mathbf{b}$.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathbf{c}&=\\overrightarrow{OX}+\\overrightarrow{XC}\\\\&=-2\\mathbf{a}+3\\mathbf{b}\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSince $\\mathbf{a}$ and $\\mathbf{b}$ are not parallel, their coefficients are unique. Matching coefficients gives $\\lambda=-2$ and $\\mu=3$."] [:db/add "dd30c11b-b5c7-5075-8cd9-10d8eaf23ea0" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add "dd30c11b-b5c7-5075-8cd9-10d8eaf23ea0" :question/answer-fields "ae3042e4-abbe-5130-aa21-f26f8c8b01c8"] [:db/add "dd30c11b-b5c7-5075-8cd9-10d8eaf23ea0" :question/answer-fields "50b7d522-b38d-5763-91fe-154a18de07ee"] [:db/ensure "dd30c11b-b5c7-5075-8cd9-10d8eaf23ea0" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186096652 :knowledge-point/questions "dd30c11b-b5c7-5075-8cd9-10d8eaf23ea0"] [:db/add "06e62fa1-b0d8-5e1d-a594-9813aae0ad1a" :answer/id #uuid "06e62fa1-b0d8-5e1d-a594-9813aae0ad1a"] [:db/add "06e62fa1-b0d8-5e1d-a594-9813aae0ad1a" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "06e62fa1-b0d8-5e1d-a594-9813aae0ad1a" :answer/value "2"] [:db/ensure "06e62fa1-b0d8-5e1d-a594-9813aae0ad1a" :answer/validate] [:db/add "97ba730e-6f70-5215-b92b-c00efe014214" :answer-field/id #uuid "97ba730e-6f70-5215-b92b-c00efe014214"] [:db/add "97ba730e-6f70-5215-b92b-c00efe014214" :answer-field/key "field-1"] [:db/add "97ba730e-6f70-5215-b92b-c00efe014214" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "97ba730e-6f70-5215-b92b-c00efe014214" :answer-field/choices "06e62fa1-b0d8-5e1d-a594-9813aae0ad1a"] [:db/add "97ba730e-6f70-5215-b92b-c00efe014214" :answer-field/correct "06e62fa1-b0d8-5e1d-a594-9813aae0ad1a"] [:db/ensure "97ba730e-6f70-5215-b92b-c00efe014214" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "b8962b24-6192-5520-881d-4f719da6e48f" :answer/id #uuid "b8962b24-6192-5520-881d-4f719da6e48f"] [:db/add "b8962b24-6192-5520-881d-4f719da6e48f" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "b8962b24-6192-5520-881d-4f719da6e48f" :answer/value "-2"] [:db/ensure "b8962b24-6192-5520-881d-4f719da6e48f" :answer/validate] [:db/add "4a2d44a0-d869-5067-9dc6-525d01e437f1" :answer-field/id #uuid "4a2d44a0-d869-5067-9dc6-525d01e437f1"] [:db/add "4a2d44a0-d869-5067-9dc6-525d01e437f1" :answer-field/key "field-2"] [:db/add "4a2d44a0-d869-5067-9dc6-525d01e437f1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "4a2d44a0-d869-5067-9dc6-525d01e437f1" :answer-field/choices "b8962b24-6192-5520-881d-4f719da6e48f"] [:db/add "4a2d44a0-d869-5067-9dc6-525d01e437f1" :answer-field/correct "b8962b24-6192-5520-881d-4f719da6e48f"] [:db/ensure "4a2d44a0-d869-5067-9dc6-525d01e437f1" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "daa4a0cd-86e7-5a53-96e6-930d96121747" :question/id #uuid "daa4a0cd-86e7-5a53-96e6-930d96121747"] [:db/add "daa4a0cd-86e7-5a53-96e6-930d96121747" :question/problem "The vectors are drawn on a square grid: $\\overrightarrow{OA}=\\mathbf{a}$, $\\overrightarrow{OB}=\\mathbf{b}$, and $\\overrightarrow{OC}=\\mathbf{c}$.\n\n![Vector diagram](images/a5/a54112c9a79362b29b52e91f8b1773cd8adc7b7c6b7e2d8d83eeabb2f72a6f4b.png)\n\nGiven that $\\mathbf{c}=\\lambda\\mathbf{a}+\\mu\\mathbf{b}$, find $\\lambda$ and $\\mu$.\n\n$\\lambda=$ {{field-1}}\n\n$\\mu=$ {{field-2}}"] [:db/add "daa4a0cd-86e7-5a53-96e6-930d96121747" :question/worked-solution "![Completed vector route](images/e1/e1de5bf39714b39ab3f2b0c154a48fa723de4fd96a86ffc06a9f7c799edf8986.png)\n\nConstruct the route $O\\to X\\to C$, first parallel to $\\mathbf{a}$ and then parallel to $\\mathbf{b}$.\n\nAlong $OX$, move $2$ squares left and $4$ squares down. A copy of $\\mathbf{a}$ moves $1$ square left and $2$ squares down. Thus $OX=2|\\mathbf{a}|$ and the segment points in the same direction to $\\mathbf{a}$. Hence $\\overrightarrow{OX}=2\\mathbf{a}$.\n\nAlong $XC$, move $2$ squares right and $2$ squares up. A copy of $\\mathbf{b}$ moves $1$ square left and $1$ square down. Thus $XC=2|\\mathbf{b}|$ and the segment points in the opposite direction to $\\mathbf{b}$. Hence $\\overrightarrow{XC}=-2\\mathbf{b}$.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathbf{c}&=\\overrightarrow{OX}+\\overrightarrow{XC}\\\\&=2\\mathbf{a}-2\\mathbf{b}\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSince $\\mathbf{a}$ and $\\mathbf{b}$ are not parallel, their coefficients are unique. Matching coefficients gives $\\lambda=2$ and $\\mu=-2$."] [:db/add "daa4a0cd-86e7-5a53-96e6-930d96121747" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add "daa4a0cd-86e7-5a53-96e6-930d96121747" :question/answer-fields "97ba730e-6f70-5215-b92b-c00efe014214"] [:db/add "daa4a0cd-86e7-5a53-96e6-930d96121747" :question/answer-fields "4a2d44a0-d869-5067-9dc6-525d01e437f1"] [:db/ensure "daa4a0cd-86e7-5a53-96e6-930d96121747" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186096652 :knowledge-point/questions "daa4a0cd-86e7-5a53-96e6-930d96121747"] [:db/add "4cee560a-717f-516f-921b-d306b6669a2a" :answer/id #uuid "4cee560a-717f-516f-921b-d306b6669a2a"] [:db/add "4cee560a-717f-516f-921b-d306b6669a2a" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "4cee560a-717f-516f-921b-d306b6669a2a" :answer/value "-3"] [:db/ensure "4cee560a-717f-516f-921b-d306b6669a2a" :answer/validate] [:db/add "a779b0a7-8425-5967-bfea-53aaa14a0f77" :answer-field/id #uuid "a779b0a7-8425-5967-bfea-53aaa14a0f77"] [:db/add "a779b0a7-8425-5967-bfea-53aaa14a0f77" :answer-field/key "field-1"] [:db/add "a779b0a7-8425-5967-bfea-53aaa14a0f77" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "a779b0a7-8425-5967-bfea-53aaa14a0f77" :answer-field/choices "4cee560a-717f-516f-921b-d306b6669a2a"] [:db/add "a779b0a7-8425-5967-bfea-53aaa14a0f77" :answer-field/correct "4cee560a-717f-516f-921b-d306b6669a2a"] [:db/ensure "a779b0a7-8425-5967-bfea-53aaa14a0f77" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "153120c8-35a6-557b-b67b-c99479f7b7bb" :answer/id #uuid "153120c8-35a6-557b-b67b-c99479f7b7bb"] [:db/add "153120c8-35a6-557b-b67b-c99479f7b7bb" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "153120c8-35a6-557b-b67b-c99479f7b7bb" :answer/value "-2"] [:db/ensure "153120c8-35a6-557b-b67b-c99479f7b7bb" :answer/validate] [:db/add "62e0303d-0d43-5fec-8fff-251b531d13be" :answer-field/id #uuid "62e0303d-0d43-5fec-8fff-251b531d13be"] [:db/add "62e0303d-0d43-5fec-8fff-251b531d13be" :answer-field/key "field-2"] [:db/add "62e0303d-0d43-5fec-8fff-251b531d13be" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "62e0303d-0d43-5fec-8fff-251b531d13be" :answer-field/choices "153120c8-35a6-557b-b67b-c99479f7b7bb"] [:db/add "62e0303d-0d43-5fec-8fff-251b531d13be" :answer-field/correct "153120c8-35a6-557b-b67b-c99479f7b7bb"] [:db/ensure "62e0303d-0d43-5fec-8fff-251b531d13be" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "6adb066b-ffdb-5044-8b11-d0799ecdd208" :question/id #uuid "6adb066b-ffdb-5044-8b11-d0799ecdd208"] [:db/add "6adb066b-ffdb-5044-8b11-d0799ecdd208" :question/problem "The vectors are drawn on a square grid: $\\overrightarrow{OA}=\\mathbf{a}$, $\\overrightarrow{OB}=\\mathbf{b}$, and $\\overrightarrow{OC}=\\mathbf{c}$.\n\n![Vector diagram](images/c0/c053f792a7c1768a15f14990618a54fd75f800a8f0c3d13ebf1524eb37d9574b.png)\n\nGiven that $\\mathbf{c}=\\lambda\\mathbf{a}+\\mu\\mathbf{b}$, find $\\lambda$ and $\\mu$.\n\n$\\lambda=$ {{field-1}}\n\n$\\mu=$ {{field-2}}"] [:db/add "6adb066b-ffdb-5044-8b11-d0799ecdd208" :question/worked-solution "![Completed vector route](images/03/03ced4f79d7a92dea3de200bb8ea9e59c84dc8b76cfb0e66f1ef8626df167bd7.png)\n\nConstruct the route $O\\to X\\to C$, first parallel to $\\mathbf{b}$ and then parallel to $\\mathbf{a}$.\n\nAlong $OX$, move $4$ squares left and $4$ squares up. A copy of $\\mathbf{b}$ moves $2$ squares right and $2$ squares down. Thus $OX=2|\\mathbf{b}|$ and the segment points in the opposite direction to $\\mathbf{b}$. Hence $\\overrightarrow{OX}=-2\\mathbf{b}$.\n\nAlong $XC$, move $6$ squares left and $3$ squares up. A copy of $\\mathbf{a}$ moves $2$ squares right and $1$ square down. Thus $XC=3|\\mathbf{a}|$ and the segment points in the opposite direction to $\\mathbf{a}$. Hence $\\overrightarrow{XC}=-3\\mathbf{a}$.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathbf{c}&=\\overrightarrow{OX}+\\overrightarrow{XC}\\\\&=-2\\mathbf{b}-3\\mathbf{a}\\\\&=-3\\mathbf{a}-2\\mathbf{b}\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nReorder the terms to match their vector names. Since $\\mathbf{a}$ and $\\mathbf{b}$ are not parallel, their coefficients are unique. Matching coefficients gives $\\lambda=-3$ and $\\mu=-2$."] [:db/add "6adb066b-ffdb-5044-8b11-d0799ecdd208" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add "6adb066b-ffdb-5044-8b11-d0799ecdd208" :question/answer-fields "a779b0a7-8425-5967-bfea-53aaa14a0f77"] [:db/add "6adb066b-ffdb-5044-8b11-d0799ecdd208" :question/answer-fields "62e0303d-0d43-5fec-8fff-251b531d13be"] [:db/ensure "6adb066b-ffdb-5044-8b11-d0799ecdd208" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186096652 :knowledge-point/questions "6adb066b-ffdb-5044-8b11-d0799ecdd208"] [:db/add "93bfe3a4-9df7-5eef-89f1-f7e86f962fef" :answer/id #uuid "93bfe3a4-9df7-5eef-89f1-f7e86f962fef"] [:db/add "93bfe3a4-9df7-5eef-89f1-f7e86f962fef" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "93bfe3a4-9df7-5eef-89f1-f7e86f962fef" :answer/value "-\\frac{3}{2}"] [:db/ensure "93bfe3a4-9df7-5eef-89f1-f7e86f962fef" :answer/validate] [:db/add "ec569f7b-5b15-5ad1-80d0-44ce6ac4d4bb" :answer-field/id #uuid "ec569f7b-5b15-5ad1-80d0-44ce6ac4d4bb"] [:db/add "ec569f7b-5b15-5ad1-80d0-44ce6ac4d4bb" :answer-field/key "field-1"] [:db/add "ec569f7b-5b15-5ad1-80d0-44ce6ac4d4bb" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "ec569f7b-5b15-5ad1-80d0-44ce6ac4d4bb" :answer-field/choices "93bfe3a4-9df7-5eef-89f1-f7e86f962fef"] [:db/add "ec569f7b-5b15-5ad1-80d0-44ce6ac4d4bb" :answer-field/correct "93bfe3a4-9df7-5eef-89f1-f7e86f962fef"] [:db/ensure "ec569f7b-5b15-5ad1-80d0-44ce6ac4d4bb" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "0a6cb272-044d-5cac-ac46-5ed74064cfbd" :answer/id #uuid "0a6cb272-044d-5cac-ac46-5ed74064cfbd"] [:db/add "0a6cb272-044d-5cac-ac46-5ed74064cfbd" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "0a6cb272-044d-5cac-ac46-5ed74064cfbd" :answer/value "1"] [:db/ensure "0a6cb272-044d-5cac-ac46-5ed74064cfbd" :answer/validate] [:db/add "63a858fa-0e34-566a-bfa8-898b3ebd1765" :answer-field/id #uuid "63a858fa-0e34-566a-bfa8-898b3ebd1765"] [:db/add "63a858fa-0e34-566a-bfa8-898b3ebd1765" :answer-field/key "field-2"] [:db/add "63a858fa-0e34-566a-bfa8-898b3ebd1765" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "63a858fa-0e34-566a-bfa8-898b3ebd1765" :answer-field/choices "0a6cb272-044d-5cac-ac46-5ed74064cfbd"] [:db/add "63a858fa-0e34-566a-bfa8-898b3ebd1765" :answer-field/correct "0a6cb272-044d-5cac-ac46-5ed74064cfbd"] [:db/ensure "63a858fa-0e34-566a-bfa8-898b3ebd1765" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "ff939039-65aa-5c40-a0d7-2bf0b00093b1" :question/id #uuid "ff939039-65aa-5c40-a0d7-2bf0b00093b1"] [:db/add "ff939039-65aa-5c40-a0d7-2bf0b00093b1" :question/problem "The vectors are drawn on a square grid: $\\overrightarrow{OA}=\\mathbf{a}$, $\\overrightarrow{OB}=\\mathbf{b}$, and $\\overrightarrow{OC}=\\mathbf{c}$.\n\n![Vector diagram](images/23/234549b34d36148a9fa6c907b68af712f3a5ff648508c9e839e3241d8e317cd0.png)\n\nGiven that $\\mathbf{c}=\\lambda\\mathbf{a}+\\mu\\mathbf{b}$, find $\\lambda$ and $\\mu$.\n\n$\\lambda=$ {{field-1}}\n\n$\\mu=$ {{field-2}}"] [:db/add "ff939039-65aa-5c40-a0d7-2bf0b00093b1" :question/worked-solution "![Completed vector route](images/ef/ef07cad1df5c81239c5fcddbf9579fb5ed6ae7a030a18b428b7291ad8b95783c.png)\n\nConstruct the route $O\\to X\\to C$, first parallel to $\\mathbf{a}$ and then parallel to $\\mathbf{b}$.\n\nAlong $OX$, move $6$ squares right and $3$ squares down. A copy of $\\mathbf{a}$ moves $4$ squares left and $2$ squares up. Thus $OX=\\frac{3}{2}|\\mathbf{a}|$ and the segment points in the opposite direction to $\\mathbf{a}$. Hence $\\overrightarrow{OX}=-\\frac{3}{2}\\mathbf{a}$.\n\nAlong $XC$, move $2$ squares left and $2$ squares up. A copy of $\\mathbf{b}$ moves $2$ squares left and $2$ squares up. Thus $XC=1|\\mathbf{b}|$ and the segment points in the same direction to $\\mathbf{b}$. Hence $\\overrightarrow{XC}=\\mathbf{b}$.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathbf{c}&=\\overrightarrow{OX}+\\overrightarrow{XC}\\\\&=-\\frac{3}{2}\\mathbf{a}+\\mathbf{b}\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSince $\\mathbf{a}$ and $\\mathbf{b}$ are not parallel, their coefficients are unique. Matching coefficients gives $\\lambda=-\\frac{3}{2}$ and $\\mu=1$."] [:db/add "ff939039-65aa-5c40-a0d7-2bf0b00093b1" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add "ff939039-65aa-5c40-a0d7-2bf0b00093b1" :question/answer-fields "ec569f7b-5b15-5ad1-80d0-44ce6ac4d4bb"] [:db/add "ff939039-65aa-5c40-a0d7-2bf0b00093b1" :question/answer-fields "63a858fa-0e34-566a-bfa8-898b3ebd1765"] [:db/ensure "ff939039-65aa-5c40-a0d7-2bf0b00093b1" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186096652 :knowledge-point/questions "ff939039-65aa-5c40-a0d7-2bf0b00093b1"] [:db/add "9d4e3ae4-4100-5956-91db-0ae884b9da96" :answer/id #uuid "9d4e3ae4-4100-5956-91db-0ae884b9da96"] [:db/add 